  "details": "the bio should still have the slide down bar and not read more... \n\nthe overall profile should have also smaller profiles (icon & image) so that there are less lights coming, i'm not epileptic nor dyslexic but lights are hurting my eyes a lot, even the ones who don't have the decorations.. \n\ntoo much bright lights so there should have a way to add a \"dark filter\" to the profiles (like the bloom settings in some worlds but with profiles this time in vrchat as itself)\n\ntexts should also be bigger for the bio, rank, status & pronouns since they are the basic things we look along with the username... the badges should be smaller than they are and all the \"read more\" could be above the right corner so that it's not space wasted over nothing.",
